{"id":71313,"date":"2026-10-29T19:21:18","date_gmt":"2026-10-29T19:21:18","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=71313"},"modified":"2026-10-29T20:22:40","modified_gmt":"2026-10-29T19:22:40","slug":"sao-silvestre-cocheiros-comp-a","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-cocheiros-comp-a\/","title":{"rendered":"4\u00aa S\u00e3o Silvestre Cocheiros &#038; Comp.\u00aa 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">4\u00aa S\u00e3o Silvestre Cocheiros & Comp.\u00aa 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>4\u00aa S\u00e3o Silvestre Cocheiros &amp; Comp.\u00aa 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>26 de Dezembro de 2026<\/strong> (S\u00e1bado), com partida e chegada na <strong>Pra\u00e7a da Restaura\u00e7\u00e3o<\/strong>, em <strong>Santo Aleixo da Restaura\u00e7\u00e3o<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Moura<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Beja<\/strong>. Disputada em ambiente festivo na hist\u00f3rica aldeia raiana da margem esquerda do Guadiana, esta prova noturna de final de ano conjuga o desporto com o conv\u00edvio comunit\u00e1rio alentejano.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo integra uma <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> cronometrada (reservada a maiores de 18 anos, com controlos de passagem ao longo do tra\u00e7ado urbano) e uma <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> de lazer (aberta tamb\u00e9m a menores de idade), ambas com tiro de partida \u00e0s <strong>18:00<\/strong> ap\u00f3s o briefing das 17:45, antecedidas \u00e0s <strong>16:00<\/strong> por uma <strong>Corrida Infantil<\/strong>. O secretariado abre \u00e0s 10:00 no mercado da Pra\u00e7a da Restaura\u00e7\u00e3o e todos os inscritos usufruem de seguro desportivo, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos antes da partida e na meta, duches e conv\u00edvio p\u00f3s-prova \u00e0s 19:30 com caldo verde, bifana, bebida e anima\u00e7\u00e3o musical.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pela <strong>BTT Cocheiros Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva<\/strong> com o apoio da <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Moura<\/strong> e da <strong>Junta de Freguesia de Santo Aleixo da Restaura\u00e7\u00e3o<\/strong>, a competi\u00e7\u00e3o distingue com trof\u00e9us os cinco primeiros classificados masculinos e femininos da geral, bem como a melhor equipa (apurada \u00e0 passagem do 3\u00ba elemento). Esta prova integra o calend\u00e1rio oficial das <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-sao-silvestre\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de S\u00e3o Silvestre em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">26 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Pra\u00e7a da Restaura\u00e7\u00e3o, Santo Aleixo da Restaura\u00e7\u00e3o, Moura, Beja<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: u